# Top-level .gitignore (added 2026-08-23, M12.5 hygiene).
#
# This file exists so that any future `git init` at the repo root cannot
# accidentally stage secrets or build artefacts. The actual `.env` file
# (with the OPENCODE_GO_APIKEY value) lives at the repo root, NOT inside
# `smolcode/`, so the existing `smolcode/.gitignore` does not cover it
# when the git root is the parent directory. Mirror the relevant patterns
# here so both layouts are protected.
#
# See `docs/decisions/0015-m12-spa-ux-polish-cli-parity.md` §11 for the
# key-rotation procedure; the leaked key value is NEVER echoed in any
# tracked file (verified 2026-08-23 by grepping the tree for the unique
# token prefix; zero matches).

# ---- Env files (NEVER commit secrets) -----------------------------------
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.local.env
*.env.bak
*.env.old

# ---- Python cache / build -----------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
*.egg
build/
dist/

# ---- Virtualenvs --------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/

# ---- Test / coverage ----------------------------------------------------
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
coverage.xml
coverage.txt

# ---- Audit / logs -------------------------------------------------------
logs/
*.jsonl
*.log

# ---- IDE / OS -----------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---- Editor backups -----------------------------------------------------
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ---- Sibling projects (each is its own repo with its own .git/) -------
# When git is initialised at this root, the inner `.git/` directories of
# these projects become orphan files inside the working tree. Excluding
# the directories entirely keeps them out of the smol_code commit.
smolagents/
smolagents-ui/
smolagents-hybrid-search/
smolagents_ui/
docutranslate-ai/
agent/
research_doc/

# ---- Runtime artefacts (workspace/, data/) -------------------------------
workspace/
data/

# ---- Build scratch (untracked logs from earlier dev sessions) ------------
tmp_*.txt
tmp_*.log
tmp_*.err
tmp_*.json
tmp_*.out

# ---- One-off screenshot dumps (smolcode/web manual QA captures) ---------
python projectssmol_clone_2smolcodeweb__screenshots/

# ---- Internal agent-tool state (not project content) ----------------------
.mavis/
